ella","intro":"Le riz au safran, avec poulet, chorizo, crevettes, moules et petits pois.","minutes":60,"calories":650,"difficulty":"Moyen","imageSearch":"seafood paella","veg":false,"oven":false,"cold":false,"missing":"","origin":"Plat espagnol","serves":4,"items":[{"name":"riz rond","plural":"riz rond","qty":350,"unit":"g","have":false},{"name":"haut de cuisse de poulet","plural":"hauts de cuisse de poulet","qty":4,"unit":"","have":false},{"name":"chorizo","plural":"chorizo","qty":100,"unit":"g","have":false},{"name":"crevette","plural":"crevettes","qty":8,"unit":"","have":false},{"name":"moule","plural":"moules","qty":500,"unit":"g","have":false},{"name":"petits pois","plural":"petits pois","qty":150,"unit":"g","have":false},{"name":"poivron rouge","plural":"poivrons rouges","qty":1,"unit":"","have":false},{"name":"oignon","plural":"oignons","qty":1,"unit":"","have":false},{"name":"tomate","plural":"tomates","qty":2,"unit":"","have":false},{"name":"safran","plural":"safran","qty":1,"unit":"","have":false},{"name":"bouillon de volaille","plural":"bouillons de volaille","qty":2,"unit":"","have":false},{"name":"huile d'olive","plural":"huile d'olive","qty":4,"unit":"c. à s.","have":false},{"name":"sel","plural":"sels","qty":null,"unit":"","have":false}],"steps":[{"text":"Fais dorer le poulet en morceaux et le chorizo dans l'huile, dans une grande poêle.","timer":null},{"text":"Ajoute l'oignon, le poivron et les tomates en dés, cuis 5 min.","timer":{"label":"Cuisson","min":5}},{"text":"Ajoute le riz, le safran, puis 1 l d'eau chaude avec les bouillons. Ne remue plus.","timer":null},{"text":"Laisse cuire 15 min, puis ajoute les crevettes, les moules et les petits pois.","timer":{"label":"Cuisson","min":15}},{"text":"Couvre et cuis encore 10 min, jusqu'à ce que les moules s'ouvrent.","timer":{"label":"Cuisson","min":10}}]},{"title":"Curry vert thaï au poulet","intro":"Du poulet et des légumes dans un lait de coco parfumé à la pâte de curry vert et au basilic.","minutes"